hākur"],"subtitle":["Kīrtan One"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["hari he!","prapañche poḍiyā,    agati hoiyā,","    nā dekhi upāya āra","agatira gati,    charaṇe śaraṇa,","    tomāya karinu sāra"],"translation":["O my Lord Hari! Having fallen into the illusion of this world, thus rendered helpless, I see no other means of deliverance but You. Since You are the only recourse for the helpless, I accept the shelter of Your lotus feet as most essential."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["karama geyāna,    kichhu nāhi mora,","    sādhana bhajana nāi","tumi kṛpā-maya,    āmi to’ kāṅgāla,","    ahaitukī kṛpā chāi"],"translation":["I have no background of pious activities, nor any knowledge, nor any regulated devotional practice. But You are full of compassion and kindness; therefore I, being indeed destitute, solicit Your causeless mercy."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vākya-mana-vega,    krodha-jihvā-vega,","    udara-upastha-vega","miliyā e saba,    saṁsāre bhāsāye,","    ditechhe paramodvega"],"translation":["The powerful urges of speech, mind, anger, tongue, belly, and genitals have banded together to cast me adrift on the sea of this material world, thus causing me grievous trouble."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["aneka jatane,    se saba damane,","    chhāḍiyāchhi āśā āmi","anāthera nātha!    ḍāki tava nāma,","    ekhana bharasā tumi"],"translation":["After numerous endeavours to subdue these material demands, I have completely given up all hope. O Lord of the destitute! I call upon Your Holy Name, for now You are my only hope."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/33-prapance-pariya","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/prapanche-podiya","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Bhajan-Lālasā-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/hari-he-prapanche-podiya-agati-hoiya/","description":"Bhajan-lālasā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Bhajan-lālasā. Kīrtan One | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"hari-he-prapanche-podiya-agati-hoiya"}}